{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/caf7f5345dda331c7bcd16086893df7b.poster.avif?t=1763631867\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/caf7f5345dda331c7bcd16086893df7b.webm?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/caf7f5345dda331c7bcd16086893df7b.mp4?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE FAILURE AND BECOME STRONGER FOR IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>near the fear</strong> is an arcade roguelite driving game set in surreal world of human subconscious. Drive on ever-changing tracks where everything is trying to stop you. Unlock new abilities and upgrades and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/f1449cd3f12e3653138b7983bd230165.poster.avif?t=1763631867\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/f1449cd3f12e3653138b7983bd230165.webm?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/f1449cd3f12e3653138b7983bd230165.mp4?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND THE LIGHT OR SUCCUMB TO DARKNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you play the game shapes the world around you. Tracks, environments and music change based on your playstyle. Lean into darkness and explore macabre landscapes. Fight it and find yourself in a world of peaceful harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/2d3b5a3e80a3ac4f0665855f5bac7e79.poster.avif?t=1763631867\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/2d3b5a3e80a3ac4f0665855f5bac7e79.webm?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/extras/2d3b5a3e80a3ac4f0665855f5bac7e79.mp4?t=1763631867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE INNER REALM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outrun your nemesis which takes different form in each themed World. Drive through a fleshy landscape between neuron synapses, on broken roads of a fallen civilization, or a misty forest leading you astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1927200?t=1763631867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1927200?t=1763631867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/1e5f6a78e18f2fc435ca6e0ac8327249c531239f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763631867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927200/1e5f6a78e18f2fc435ca6e0ac8327249c531239f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763631867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Inpu